* 首页的宏

<<<
```
<$list filter="[tag[project]tag[todo]sort[created]]">

<div class="myDiv" style="margin-top: 200px">
<<interstitial-ui caption:"!!<$link to=<<currentTiddler>>>{{!!title}}</$link>" width:"100%" base:"$(currentTiddler)$">>
</div>

</$list>

<$let  now_date=<<now YYYY0MM0DD>> >
<$vars rb="[get[end]compare:date:gteq<now_date>]">
<$vars lb="[get[start]compare:date:lteq<now_date>]">
<$list filter="[tag[timeline]has[start]has[end]filter<lb>filter<rb>]">

<div class="myDiv">
<$transclude $variable=interstitial-ui caption="!!<$link to=<<currentTiddler>>>{{!!title}}</$link>" base=<<currentTiddler>> />
</div>
 
</$list>
```
